# Clock In/Out System Documentation Directory

This file ensures the clockInOutSystem directory is tracked by Git even when empty.

## Directory Structure
- `00_CURRENT_SYSTEM_ANALYSIS.md` - Current system documentation
- `01_IDENTIFIED_ISSUES.md` - Problem analysis and issues
- `02_SHIFT_CONFIGURATION_SYSTEM.md` - Infrastructure design
- `03_ACTIVE_SHIFT_ENFORCEMENT.md` - Security implementation
- `04_AUTO_CLOCK_OUT_SYSTEM.md` - Automation system
- `05_SHIFT_TIMING_VALIDATION.md` - Time enforcement
- `06_ENHANCED_UI_NOTIFICATIONS.md` - User experience
- `07_DATABASE_MIGRATIONS.md` - Data layer changes
- `08_SCHEDULING_CONFIGURATION.md` - Background jobs
- `09_IMPLEMENTATION_SEQUENCE.md` - Rollout plan
- `10_TESTING_STRATEGY.md` - Quality assurance
- `11_MONITORING_ALERTS.md` - System health
- `12_USER_GUIDANCE_UPDATES.md` - Training materials
- `13_MAINTENANCE_OPERATIONS.md` - Ongoing support
- `README.md` - Project overview
- `CHANGELOG.md` - Version history
- `IMPLEMENTATION_CHECKLIST.md` - Deployment checklist